# Place a portal pair, then throw a glacier into the primary. The
# glacier should appear at the secondary on the other side. Used to
# verify the portal-traveler path works for the rolling-glacier body.
#
# Layout (top-down): glacier starts at z=5, primary at z=-3 facing
# south (+Z normal), secondary at z=10 facing north (-Z normal). The
# ball rolls -Z, enters primary, should warp out of secondary moving
# in -Z direction (out of the secondary's front).
0.5  place_portal primary 0 1 -3  0 0 1
0.7  place_portal secondary 0 1 10  0 0 -1
1.2  throw_glacier 0 1.5 5  0 0 -9
9.0  exit
